            <ArticleTitle>[Effect of electrochemical treatment of heart valve prostheses on their antithrombogenicity].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>40-1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>For producing artificial cardiac valves possessing high antitrombogenic properties, two methods of their treatment were investigated: mechanical and electrochemical. It was found that electrochemical polishing reduced the possibility of thrombogenesis.</AbstractText>
